      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "For color contrast, ensure all text and important graphical elements meet a minimum contrast ratio of 4.5:1 for standard text under WCAG 2.1. Regarding screen readers, focus on providing meaningful and accurate alternative text (alt text) for all non-text content like images. Furthermore, make sure all interactive elements have clear, programmatically associated labels so screen readers can announce their function correctly.",
