      "content": "These elusive bugs can often be categorized as integration issues or environmental sensitivities. Integration issues arise when different parts of the app interact unexpectedly, while environmental sensitivities relate to how the code behaves across specific operating system or device permutations. Systematically logging the exact environment and user behavior when the bug appears is crucial for recreating and isolating the root cause.",
